        "responsibility": "Provide deterministic typed application validation, bounded diagnostics, explicit presence semantics, reusable rules, and transport-neutral report composition.",
        "non_goals": [
          "Bind or decode requests, own DTOs, perform network deliverability checks, or provide schema-language validation.",
          "Own application message catalogs, transport routing, persistence, retries, or service lifecycle.",
          "Retain rejected values, panic payloads, unbounded diagnostic state, or process-global configuration."
